# - NumaAffinity  (Filter + Score)  — T006 (wraps sigs.k8s.io/scheduler-plugins/pkg/noderesourcetopology)
# - Binpack       (Score)            — T007 (internal thin impl, default disabled per ADR-0010 §4)
#
# Framework: sigs.k8s.io/scheduler-plugins v0.31.x (K8s 1.32 baseline per
# P5-T-114 kind smoke + ADR-0010 §1).

